      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-02T22:03:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From the current API, I am afraid those \"RadioError\" codes is the only error information we can get from the modem.",
      "parentUuid": "deb5bc78_d2731b85",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 43,
        "startChar": 0,
