      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-02T22:03:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Those errors are actually directly mapped from the RIL errors, not sure how they distinguish \"RadioError:OPERATION_NOT_ALLOWED\" from \"RadioError:REQUEST_NOT_SUPPORTED\". I guess for example if we request a scan on RAN CDMA, we may get a \"REQUEST_NOT_SUPPORTED\" instead of \"OPERATION_NOT_ALLOWED\"",
      "parentUuid": "d48c7141_cddff2de",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
